
Solana RPC used by the server.

SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com

Required for authenticated HTTP execution.
Use a long random value and never commit the real secret.

SOLANA_AGENT_API_KEY=

JSON array containing exactly 64 secret-key bytes.
Never commit a real value.

AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY=

Optional Jupiter API base URL.

JUPITER_API_URL=https://api.jup.ag/swap/v1

Express server port.

PORT=3000
